1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:02,162
(Howard:)Ouch.

2
00:00:02,667 --> 00:00:06,007
(Katee:)You've got a wonderful girl in your life,
and you're ignoring her...

3
00:00:06,171 --> 00:00:11,051
(Katee:)...to spend your nights in the bathtub
with a mental image and a washcloth.

4
00:00:12,594 --> 00:00:14,344
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard!

5
00:00:14,512 --> 00:00:16,552
(Howard's Mother:)What are you doing in there?

6
00:00:16,723 --> 00:00:18,183
(Howard:)I'm taking a bath!

7
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:23,350
(Howard's Mother:)I hope that's all you're doing!
We share that tub!

8
00:00:25,065 --> 00:00:27,065
(Howard:)Don't remind me!

9
00:00:30,028 --> 00:00:31,528
(Howard:)Oh, man.

10
00:00:31,696 --> 00:00:35,696
(Howard:)All soaped up and no place to go.

11
00:00:39,371 --> 00:00:40,911
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

12
00:00:42,874 --> 00:00:44,204
How you doing, buddy?

13
00:00:44,376 --> 00:00:47,966
(Sheldon:)I was humiliated on national radio.
How do you think I'm doing?

14
00:00:48,129 --> 00:00:49,709
(Leonard:)Come on, it wasn't that bad.

15
00:00:50,423 --> 00:00:51,463
(Sheldon:)What do you want?

16
00:00:51,633 --> 00:01:00,023
[IN MUNCHKIN VOICE] We represent
the Lollipop Guild, and we want you.

